# Keep the working tree LF on every platform: `node build.mjs --check` compares the
# generated `lib/client.js` byte for byte, and CRLF checkouts would make it fail
# before anyone touched a source file. `build.mjs` also normalises its inputs, so
# either side alone is enough — this keeps `git diff` quiet as well.
* text=auto eol=lf
